      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "72d0828ec21f8d697aca0444d286b14964415b39e8a77686bb9bcbfa020303c7"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "James’ identity (1971) relates the recurrence risk to the population prevalence and the covariance between relatives,",
