    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The first step follows by recalling $ E(z_{1}z_{2})=\\mathrm{Cov}(z_{1},z_{2})+E(z_{1})E(z_{2}) $ and $ E(z_{i})=K $.",
