    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ \\sigma_A^2 $ and $ \\sigma_D^2 $ are the additive and dominance variances associated with this character (measured on the 0/1 scale), $ \\Theta_{12} $ is the coefficient of coancestry, and $ \\Delta_{12} $ is the coefficient of fraternity for these two individuals (Chapter 7). Hence,",
