    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ K_{O} $ and $ K_{S} $ denote, respectively, the recurrent risk for parent-offspring and full-sib pairs. Likewise, the total genetic variance $ \\sigma_{G}^{2} $, even in the presence of epistasis, is",
      "source_page": 538,
